(F5 T5 U10: group_beam_force_moment_plasti, shear force and torsion
 limits, equilibrium kept. Cantilever of length 1 along x, E 1, Izz 1,
 G 1, J 1. Tip deflection prescribed (vely 0.1, disy 1 at t 10) with free
 tip rotz: elastic fy = 3 E I disy / L^3 = 3; shear limit fy 0.5 at both
 nodes: fy stays 0.5 and the root moment is fy L = 0.5 (the Professional
 clips fy and keeps the elastic root moment 3, out of equilibrium). Tip
 rotx prescribed to 1: elastic torque G J rotx / L = 1; torsion limit
 0.3: mx = 0.3.)
